      "title": "Qwen-Image 2.1 Direct Pixel Head — Zero-VAE v0.3 Wavelet Decode (37.5ms) & 1:1 Comparison",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Qwen-Image 2.1 Direct Pixel Head (Zero-VAE RGB & RGBA Readout · v0.3)\n- **Default Zero-VAE Path (`~37.5 ms` on v0.3 Wavelet / `~5.5–7.8 ms` on v0.1 Fast)**: `KSampler` feeds into `10. Qwen-Image 2.1 Pixel Decode (Zero VAE)`, decoding `4096`-dim DiT features + `64`-ch `x0_hat` into RGB & Alpha without loading the `644 MB` VAE.\n- **Optional 1:1 Side-by-Side Comparison**: Select the bypassed purple nodes (`12`, `13`, `14`) at the bottom and press **`Ctrl + B`** to compare against the official Qwen-Image 2.1 VAE on the same seed.\n- **Mode Compatibility**: Works with 8-Step LoRA ON (`steps=8, cfg=1.0`) or OFF (`steps=20–25, cfg=3.5–4.5`), `QwenImage21Cache`, T2I, and `<image1>` Multi-Image Reference Editing."
      ],
      "color": "#1e2d24",
      "bgcolor": "#14221a"
    },
